---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import backgroundPattern from '../assets/background.svg';
import blogHeroImage from '../assets/stock/growtika-nGoCBxiaRO0-unsplash.jpg';
---

<Layout title="Blog" description="Read practical website design, website support, website management, and small business marketing notes from HEX Design Labs.">
	<main class="page">
		<section class="page-hero image-hero" style={`--hero-image: url(${blogHeroImage.src}); --hero-position: center; --hero-tint: #ACBC3B;`}>
			<img class="hero-base-image" src={blogHeroImage.src} alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
			<img class="hero-pattern-image" src={backgroundPattern.src} alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
			<p class="eyebrow">Blog</p>
			<h1>Notes on small business websites, design, support, and staying online.</h1>
			<p class="lead">
				A home for practical website guidance, maintenance tips, launch planning, content updates, and marketing notes for small business owners who want their website to feel clearer and easier to keep current.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="section">
			<div class="grid">
				<article class="card blog-card blog-card-red">
					<p class="eyebrow">Coming Soon</p>
					<h3>What to update before launching a new website</h3>
					<p>A practical checklist for website content, contact forms, page structure, search basics, and final review before a small business website goes live.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card blog-card blog-card-green">
					<p class="eyebrow">Coming Soon</p>
					<h3>When a website refresh is enough</h3>
					<p>How to think through a website refresh, targeted content updates, and design improvements before deciding whether a full rebuild is needed.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card blog-card blog-card-blue">
					<p class="eyebrow">Coming Soon</p>
					<h3>Why website maintenance matters</h3>
					<p>The small recurring website support tasks that help a business site stay more current, useful, and easier to manage over time.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="cta-band">
			<h2>Turn website notes into practical next steps.</h2>
			<p>Explore the practical website design, refresh, content, and support services HEX offers for small businesses.</p>
			<a href="/services" class="button">View services</a>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.blog-card {
		border: none;
		outline: none;
		background: var(--blog-card-color);
	}

	.blog-card h3,
	.blog-card p {
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
	}

	.blog-card .eyebrow {
		color: rgba(255, 253, 247, 0.82);
	}

	.blog-card-red {
		--blog-card-color: #DC4F41;
	}

	.blog-card-green {
		--blog-card-color: #ACBC3B;
	}

	.blog-card-blue {
		--blog-card-color: #54B8ED;
	}
</style>
